                    \\,.
            %p
              This extension is not unique. A choice of such an extension, satisfying some evident compatibility conditions, is a choice of
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/renormalization+scheme"} renormalization scheme
              for the given
