          %h2#references References
          %p The construction goes back to
          %ul
            %li#Wick50
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gian-Carlo+Wick"}> Gian-Carlo Wick
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The evaluation of the collision matrix
          %p
            Its realization as the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Moyal+deformation+quantization"} Moyal deformation quantization
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peierls+bracket"} Peierls bracket
            shifted by a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quasi-free+Hadamard+state"} quasi-free Hadamard state
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#Dito90
